<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's Abbey H1 pretax 3.56 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Ireland's Abbey H1 pretax 3.56 mln punts.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.16		   vs 5.19</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.2		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    3.56		   vs 3.00</p>
<p> Turnover		   28.89		  vs 22.43</p>
<p> Operating profit	 3.27		   vs 2.78</p>
<p> Interest receivable    0.29		   vs 0.22</p>
<p> Tax charge, estimated  1.18		   vs 0.99</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.39		   vs 2.01</p>
<p> Registration date	Jan 28</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 18</p>
<p> Ex-dividend date	 Jan 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction group Abbey Plc said the outlook for all its activities was encouraging and it was hopeful of being able to report further progress in the summer.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 661 3377</p>
</text>
